ations and tastings  are part of his recipe for success it  takes four sites and skillful work to  create each motif and letter each piece  of candy gets a design the letter A in  the making each big strip of sugar is  turned into one letter Bernard istván  Blanco I'm an artist to trained  hairdresser I like to see the results of  my work it's nicer than working with  machines there are plenty of candy  manufacturers that work with machines  press a button and you get candy with us  you never know we work by hand so there  are surprises you want one letter and  get another or a strawberry candy  becomes a raspberry well that's how it  is simple [ __ ] off me look bellegarde  uses a technique dating back to the 17th  century in the year 2012 he started  selling his candies in Germany too they  were a big hit during the euro 2012  soccer championship and they still  attract a lot of German tourists here in  Gdansk I know we start with 160 degrees  Celsius but now I can break it black red  gold for Germany right this dish  ambitious customers can even have a go  at designing their own candies for Flo  Leon been gone to make for them a  personalized and very tasty souvenir  from Gdansk  and that wraps up our highlights show  thanks very much for being with us and  we hope you will join us again very soon  bye-bye from Berlin
 

